      name: "Sanctuary",
      id: "cleric_sanctuary_1",
      level: 1,
      school: "abjuration",
      concentration: false,
      casting_time: "1 bonus action",
      range: [30, "ft"],
      components: ["V","S","M"],
      material_desc: "a shard of glass from a mirror",
      duration: [1, "minute"],
      desc: "You ward a creature within range. Until the spell ends, any creature \
who targets the warded creature with an attack roll or a damaging spell must succeed \
on a WIS saving throw or either choose a new target or lose the attack or spell. This \
spell doesn't protect the warded creature from areas of effect. The spell ends if the \
warded creature makes an attack roll, casts a spell, or deals damage."
